    "media:imagetext": "1908\n1928\nOn December 31, 1908, exactly twenty years ago today-Wilbur Wright established a new world's record for distance.\nand duration covering 124.7 kilometers in two hours twenty minutes thirty-two and two-tenths seconds, winning the\nMichelin Trophy and other valuable prizes. This epochal achi, marked the Tria of agrial erans portation.\nMillville, Indiana postoffice has been discontinued, now\n= DEC 31\nsupplied by New Castle, Indiana, which is 5 miles from\nthe birthplace of Wilbur Wright.\nPM\n1928\nNTER TONAL CIVIL AERONAUTICS\nCONFERENCE\nND\n186 right 192\nThis Cover is\ndedicated\nto Wilbur Wright who\ndaringly\nand honorably\naided\nscience and\nhig-\nIt is sent from\nMiliville Sniana, one\nplace of\nhis\nbirth.\n500425\nVIA AIR MAIL\nCAPT. B. B. LIPSNER\nAMERICA'S FIRST AIR MAIL SUP'T.\nCHICAGO",
